97 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (In this project, we have implemented a research-oriented university system that runs on the console. Our program is an ideal place for students and teachers at the university, as it provides everything they need in one system. Students can easily register for courses, view their marks and transcript, rate teachers, join student organizations, and subscribe to research journals. Teachers, in turn, can manage their courses, put marks, send complaints to the dean, publish research papers, and calculate their h-index. This makes the system a convenient and centralized tool for handling both academic and research activities within the university.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
